abstract: >
  This repository contains a TensorFlow/Keras reimplementation of VICReg
  (Variance-Invariance-Covariance Regularization) and an experimental Adaptive
  VICReg variant that dynamically reweights the three loss terms during
  self-supervised pretraining on CIFAR-10. It includes scripts for pretraining,
  linear evaluation, kNN evaluation, and automatic generation of plots and
  LaTeX-ready tables.
